job_description_text:
We are looking for the Back-end Developer. The candidate should have at least 3 years experience in developing using Python, common used  databases (PostgreSql, MySql, MongoDb). Highly responsible and motivated individual. 

**Responsibilities:**

Work directly with CTO to tackle tough problems and find creative ways to solve them;
Update and fix currently developed code;
Cover your code with tests to ensure stability and reliability of the software;
Improve your skills and stay up-to-date with emerging technologies.

**Skills:**

Good knowledge of Python (knowledge of other languages would be a plus);
Experience of using Web3.py is the plus;
Experience with databases;
Proficient at using GIT;
Ability to work in flexible development methodologies;
Good knowledge of algorithms and data structures;
Skills of system development.

**Technologies:**

Python 
PostgreSql
Django

