job_description_text:
Необходимые навыки
● 2+ years of experience in Python;
● AWS, serverless, Lambda, SQS, Cognito, IAM, S3, EC2, DynamoDB, SSM, SES, CloudWatch, Kibana, Jenkins;
● Experience Microservice Architecture;
● REST;
● Docker, Kubernetes;
● Self-motivation, proactivity, positive attitude;
● Strong analytical and problem-solving skills;
● English — intermediate or higher.

Будет плюсом
● Google Drive API, SharePoint API, OneDrive API;
● React, JS, Ant Design.

Предлагаем
● A competitive reward for your skills, experience, input, and results;
● Abilities to visit conferences, master classes, pass certifications;
● English classes and opportunity to learn from a native speaker;
● Full compensation package;
● Regular team events and activities.

Обязанности
● Developing new features;
● Automated test coverage for all delivered code.

