Job Description
Experience designing web apps and enterprise server systems;
2+ years of experience as Java Developer;
Experience of using SQL, Hibernate and one of more databases (Oracle, MySQL, Postgre);
Experience with the development and CI tools: maven, git, Bamboo, Jenkins, Jira, etc;
Expertise building software in Agile development environment;
B.S. in Computer Science/Engineering or related science;
English Upper-Intermediate.

Job Responsibilities
Scope grooming/estimation/planning;
Development of the release scope;
Production issues troubleshooting/system stabilization;
Collaboration with QA team

