**Our Customer:**
Our client is a cloudified and AI-driven RAN automation and orchestration platform that enables MNOs to accelerate 5G network deployment and go-to-market.

**Required experience and skills:**
At least 5 years of experience as a backend Java developer;
Experience with Spring, Spring boot;
The ability to work independently and in a team environment;
Experience building large-scale platforms;
Experience with events frameworks like: Kafka and similar;
Good experience with  MySQL, MongoDB, ActiveMQ, Vertic Docker, Jenkins etc.;
Familiarity with RESTful APIs;
English – Intermediate+.

**Would be a plus:**
Experience with Node.js (any framework).

