Our Product is a platform for companies to help them adapt coordinations to their needs and improve business processes. Companies can customize app, schedule automated messages, establish communication streams, create and distribute employee surveys, and so much more. The Product bridges gaps by connecting operational systems and communication channels within one secure platform that is accessible by mobile and desktop devices.
Now the Product has a strong presence in Silicon Valley and Europe, with customers in more than 130 different countries.

Stack of Technologies:
Java, Spring, SQL;
Vue.js, Backbone.js, ElasticSearch;
AWS, Docker;
PostgreSQL, MySQL, RabbitMQ;
Python.
About the role
As a Full-Stack developer, you will be a part of outstaff team and have such responsibilities:

• Implement requirements, designs and wireframes into inspiring user experiences;
• Build and maintain high-performance, reusable and reliable code;
• Work closely with other passionate software engineers to develop and ship new features.
**Required skills**
• 4+ years experience in software coding and development;
• Experienced in Java;
• Proficiency in Vue.js (or other Frameworks), Backbone.js, ElasticSearch;
• Skilled in Docker, AWS;
• Good knowledge of PostgreSQL, MySQL, RabbitMQ;
• Experience in Python will be a plus;
• Attention to code quality and continuous refactoring;
• Ability and willingness to delve into unfamiliar technologies;
• Bonus points for familiarity with Reactive Programming;
• Proficiency in English.
**Our benefits**
• Strong opportunities for professional and career growth - Meetups, TechClubs, Professional Library and more;
• Challenging tasks with a friendly experienced team;
• Flat hierarchy without micromanagement — our doors are open, and all teammates are approachable;
• Direct communication with stakeholders and the ability to influence product development;
• Up to 50% compensation of educational courses and conferences price for professional growth;
• Free English classes and The Business English Course;
• 23 business days leave and medical Covid support;
• Legal and accounting support;
• Regular team events and activities;
• Gifts for significant life events.

