job_description_text:
Qualifications:
- 1+ year of full-time practice as a DevOps;
- Experience with Linux;
- Experienced in AWS/DigitalOcean/GoogleCloud;
- Experience with Docker or any other container engine;
- CI/CD concept understanding, experience with one of popular CI/CD tool (GitLab CI, GitHub Actions, Jenkins);
- Understanding networking, bridges, routes, iptables, proxies, NAT’s, etc.;
- SQL/NoSQL database administration experience;
- Experience with Terraform and IaC solutions.


Duties and Responsibilities:
- Building CI/CD pipelines and new cloud infrastructure;
- Configuring, managing, and maintaining the platform;
- Using scripting languages and tools to perform automation;
- Ensuring appropriate security practices are implemented;
- Testing and implementing new technologies and tools to improve systems;
- Creating and maintaining documentation of new and existing processes;
- Implementing best DevOps and SRE practices.

