job_description_text:
Job Description
We are looking for a DevOps Engineer with proven experience with aws and kubernetes. Main responsibility is development, improvement and maintenance of current k8s clusters on top of aws, CI/CD pipelines development, participating in production support.
Project tech-stack is: k8s, aws, helm, wordpress, postgres, xtradb, mongodb, iam, reddis, spring microservices, nginx-ingress, prometheus, grafana, elk, rmq, route53.

Responsibilities
● Upgrade and maintenance of current k8s clusters;
● 3-rd party and in-house helm charts maintenance;
● Infrastructure components maintenance and continuous upgrade;
● Participation in production technical support;
● Design and implementation of new infrastructure components for development needs;
● Monitoring and improvement backuping system;
● Security improvements;
● Costs optimisation;
● Performance optimisation;
● CI/CD pipelines development, improvement and maintenance.

Skills and Qualifications
● Strong experience with kubernetes and helm;
● Strong understanding of infrastructure-as-a-code paradigm;
● Strong experience with Jenkins;
● Experience with nginx-ingress;
● Experience with prometheus and grafana;
● Experience with ELK stack;
● Experience with DB deploy in Kubernetes;
● Basic SQL knowledge;
● Basic experience with AWS: ec2, route53, s3, redshift, rds, ecr, elb/nlb, iam;
● Proficient understanding of code versioning tools, such as Git.

Personal Skills
Eager to succeed, responsible, committed and friendly.

