Requirements:
Experience with .Net for at least 2 years;
Experience with Angular 2+ for at least 2 years;
Good knowledge of SQL, practical experience with MS SQL;
Good communication skills;
Speaking English sufficient to discuss technical issues;
Good knowledge and understanding of the principles of building a Web Application.

Will be a plus:
Existence of independently implemented projects;
Experience in developing mobile applications using React Native and / or NativeScript;
Knowledge of HTML, CSS, layout principles, etc.

Responsibilities:
Development of a Web Application with our and Australian team;
The toolkit is mainly based on Atlassian solutions — JIRA, Confluence, Bitbucket;
The schedule is flexible, but in the morning you need to be in touch for direct communication with the Australian team (usually about an hour from 8 to 9 in the morning), so you need a good Internet at home and the willingness to be in touch every day.

