🙋🏻‍♂️ We are looking for a Full Stack Engineer who enjoys solving challenging requirements in a scalable fashion both within a team setting as well as on an individual basis.
🔵You’ll be joining a team of experienced professionals who enjoy spending most of their time building new features across the stack and getting immediate feedback from our users and stakeholders.
🔵Your skills in finding the right solutions in the project and solving complex tasks will become an auxiliary tool for the team.

⚠️Attention! You must be living in the European Union.

SKILLS:
📌Upper-intermediate English and higher.
Frontend:
📌Blazor, TypeScript, HTML, CSS.
Backend:
📌C#;
📌ASP.NET + TypeScript will be a bonus;
📌Experience with MVC Razor if you don’t have Blazor experience;
📌Experience developing APIs (both REST and RPC);
📌Experience in CI/CD a must;
📌Entity Framework;
📌LINQ.
Infrastructure:
📌MS Azure, Amazon ECS.
✔️Have worked and be comfortable with agile methodologies;
✔️Familiarity with image processing tooling a strong bonus;
✔️Working for a Med Tech business will be a +.
JOB RESPONSIBILITIES:
🔵Developing technical interfaces, specs and architecture;
🔵Creating prototypes.

EXPERIENCE:

🔝3+ years commercial experience.

candidate_cv_text:
Creation of CI/CD for product release. Regular product deployment. Creation of application architecture of ETL for Big Data. Ability to learn new things in a reasonable amount of time. Ability to navigate large projects.
10+ years in IT.
Project Roles: 
  - Senior Data Engineer;
  - Senior Software Engineer;
 - Team Lead Software Engineer.
I were responsible for: 
 - adding new features;
 - support exists code;
 - creation of CI/CD;
 - designing big data architecture;
 - relize of code to production;
 - writing thecnical documentations;
 - estimat tasks;
 - organization and management of the team;
 - others.
I have been use:
 - python, .net Core, javascript, typescript, SQL, HTML/CSS/LESS, Angular, 
 - Aws: CDK, API, StepFunctions, Rout53, ECS, ECR, EKS, AWS CLI, EC2, ALB, S3, EMR, IAM, RDS,
VPC, Certificate Manager, Systems Manager, AWS Lambda, Cloud Formation, Service Catalog,
Kinesis Firehose, CloudWatch, Data Lake, Glue Job, SNS, SQS, ApiGateway

job_description_text:
🙋🏻‍♂️ We are looking for a Full Stack Engineer who enjoys solving challenging requirements in a scalable fashion both within a team setting as well as on an individual basis.
🔵You’ll be joining a team of experienced professionals who enjoy spending most of their time building new features across the stack and getting immediate feedback from our users and stakeholders.
🔵Your skills in finding the right solutions in the project and solving complex tasks will become an auxiliary tool for the team.

⚠️Attention! You must be living in the European Union.

SKILLS:
📌Upper-intermediate English and higher.
Frontend:
📌Blazor, TypeScript, HTML, CSS.
Backend:
📌C#;
📌ASP.NET + TypeScript will be a bonus;
📌Experience with MVC Razor if you don’t have Blazor experience;
📌Experience developing APIs (both REST and RPC);
📌Experience in CI/CD a must;
📌Entity Framework;
📌LINQ.
Infrastructure:
📌MS Azure, Amazon ECS.
✔️Have worked and be comfortable with agile methodologies;
✔️Familiarity with image processing tooling a strong bonus;
✔️Working for a Med Tech business will be a +.
JOB RESPONSIBILITIES:
🔵Developing technical interfaces, specs and architecture;
🔵Creating prototypes.

EXPERIENCE:

🔝3+ years commercial experience.

