job_description_text:
**Responsibilities**
Build web services and software components using C#/.NET;
Writing technical documentation;
Development of new features;
Optimizing the technical solutions;
Collaboratively working with your international team to review tasks in a timely manner.

**Requirements**
At least 5+ years of experience developing applications in C#/.NET;
Deep knowledge of .NET Framework 4.5.2;
WCF, TFS;
Familiar with JS and jQuery;
Knowledge of relational database systems (e.g. SQL);
Understanding of infrastructure principles and cloud servers (e.g. AWS);
Intermediate English level.

**What we love about Innovecs**
High-level compensation and regular performance-based salary and career development reviews;
Medical insurance (health), employee assistance program;
Paid vacation, holidays and sick leaves;
Gym 24/7, personal fitness instructor;
Massage in the office, personal wellness consultant;
English classes with native speakers and partially or fully reimbursed personal trainings and conferences;
Referral program;
Team buildings and a lot of fun to take a break and relax.

