Junior .Net developer with relocate to Rothenburg.
Requirements: 
- .NET environment (VB.NET / C# / WPF / WinForms) & VB3;
- SQL / T-SQL;
- Azure DevOps Server and Salesforce; 
- ERP;
- German or good English;
- Work Permit in EU;
- relocate to Rothenburg.
We offer: €, relocate cover, RP in Germany.

Junior .Net developer with relocate to Rothenburg.

Description of the position: 

- Development, optimization, and testing of modules of the in-house ERP solution in the front and back area;
- Development of interfaces to external systems (mainly MES systems)
- Bug fixing of existing applications
- Analysis and porting of existing programs and processes
- Implementation of business process changes in cooperation with the respective departments of the company 

Requirements: 

- Training or studies in the field of computer science and ideally professional experience in software development;
- Very good knowledge of the .NET environment (VB.NET / C# / WPF / WinForms) & VB3;
- Safe handling of SQL / T-SQL and the connection to relational database systems (MS SQL Server & Informix);
- Knowledge of web technologies, Azure DevOps Server and Salesforce is an advantage; 
- Good knowledge of German and /or good English
- additional plus is a knowledge of the furniture manufacturing industry
- work permit in Germany
- readiness to relocate to Rothenburg.

We offer: Competitive salary, official employment, benefits, relocate cover and residency permit in Germany.

