job_description_text:
We are a large fast-growing IT outsourcing company with clear and simple processes.

**Technologies**

Xamarin.Forms
Firebase
AppCenter
Aptentive

**Job Requirements**

Fast learner and enjoys learning,
Intelligent and good in problem-solving,
Multithreading,
Basic knowledge of .NET Framework, C#, Data Structures,
Basic knowledge of SQL, SOLID principles, OOP,
Knowledge of written and verbal English (Upper-Intermediate).

Nice to have:

Xamarin native (iOS, Android),
Xamarin.Forms,
MAUI,
Postman/Fidler,
Experience in UnitTesting.

**We offer you**

Reliable people-oriented company;
A strong team of professionals, friendly and open to cooperation;
Opportunity to share experiences at internal meetings and conferences;
100+ technical and non-technical training for development and broadening of horizons;
Career growth and development;
Regular salary review based on employee performance;
Medical insurance from the first working day;
15 sick leave are fully compensated;
18 working days of paid leave;
IT Club Loyalty program gives a lot of discounts and bonuses;
English courses;
Remote work;
Team sports activities and corporate events.

Send your CV.

Please note that we will review all applications with due respect, but only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.

