Необхідні навички
— 2,5 + years of experience as Automation QA;
— Solid knowledge of Testing Procedures/Activities;
— Solid automation Frameworks knowledge;
— Good knowledge of OOP;
— Solid background in Java;
— Web Driver experience;
— Knowledge of automated Mobile Testing (optional);
— Solid understanding of automation API testing frameworks;
— Experience with Salesforce platform will be a plus;
— English: Upper — Intermediate +.

