— Define, select, and configure testing tools and environments based on selected test types and test approaches;
— Create automation test scripts;
— Extend the Automation Testing framework;
— Take part in requirements management: managing changes to requirements and their influence on the whole product;
— Research project areas which can be improved and suggest improvements.

