job_description_text:
Requirements:
- 3+ years of previous work experience in QA – automated QA is a must;
- 3+ years of experience in Web and Mobile testing;
- Strong knowledge of automated testing frameworks including hands on experience with QA methodologies;
- Confirmed bug detection and bug isolation skills;
- Experience with one or more Test Lab: Meliora, QC, TST, etc;
- Experience with writing STPs and STDs;
- Ability to work both individually and as part of a team;
- Familiarity with software development process;
- Familiarity with JIRA and GitHUB;
- Proficiency in English - a must.
Advantage:
- Previous work with Databases - SQL, Firebase, etc.

Responsibilities:
- Plan, prioritise and perform manual and automated test routines;
- Develop and document test procedure for use across the QA and Development team;
- Help identify weaknesses and problem areas in the software;
- Review technical specifications and design documents;
- Create test plans and cases and prepare detailed test reports;
- Design and execute functional and nonfunctional tests;
- Act as a strong advocate for quality in the product development process;
- Execute and update test cases and scenarios;
- Evaluate and test software bug fixes, extensions, and features;
- Work closely with Product Management, Development and Architecture to understand and guide product features and testing;
- Contribute to the development of new theories and methods for QA automation.

